            <span class='Ttitle'>김덕훈 내각총리 황해남도의 농업부문 사업을 현지료해</span>		
        </div>		
    </div>	
            <div align="center" style="padding-bottom:20px">
               <audio style="margin-bottom:-10px;width:60%" controls >
													<source src='../../../../resources/pyb_pddata/pyb_ipn240107001/ipn240107001.mp3' type='audio/mp3'>
